Source: https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss.com/blob/main/src/app/(docs)/docs/installation/framework-guides/nextjs.tsx

Complete setup guide for Tailwind CSS v4 with Next.js, including npm install, postcss.config.mjs configuration, and @import "tailwindcss" in globals.css.

```javascript
npm install tailwindcss @tailwindcss/postcss postcss

// postcss.config.mjs
const config = {
  plugins: {
    "@tailwindcss/postcss": {},
  },
};
export default config;

// app/globals.css
@import "tailwindcss";
```

