### Replacing @tailwind directives with @import

Source: https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss.com/blob/main/src/docs/upgrade-guide.mdx

In v4, replace `@tailwind` directives with a standard CSS `@import "tailwindcss"` statement.

```css
/* [!code filename:CSS] */
/* [!code --:4] */
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;
/* [!code ++:2] */
@import "tailwindcss";
```

