### Updated CSS variables with @theme inline

Source: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/main/apps/v4/content/docs/(root)/tailwind-v4.mdx

CSS variables updated to use `hsl()` wrappers in `:root` and `.dark` and `@theme inline` for simpler access.

```css
:root {
  --background: hsl(0 0% 100%); // <-- Wrap in hsl
  --foreground: hsl(0 0% 3.9%);
}

.dark {
  --background: hsl(0 0% 3.9%); // <-- Wrap in hsl
  --foreground: hsl(0 0% 98%);
}

@theme inline {
  --color-background: var(--background); // <-- Remove hsl
  --color-foreground: var(--foreground);
}
```

--------------------------------

### app/globals.css

Source: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/main/apps/v4/content/docs/(root)/theming.mdx

Defines new CSS custom properties for warning colors under `:root` and `.dark` and exposes them to Tailwind using `@theme inline`.

```css
:root {
  --warning: oklch(0.84 0.16 84);
  --warning-foreground: oklch(0.28 0.07 46);
}

.dark {
  --warning: oklch(0.41 0.11 46);
  --warning-foreground: oklch(0.99 0.02 95);
}

@theme inline {
  --color-warning: var(--warning);
  --color-warning-foreground: var(--warning-foreground);
}
```

--------------------------------

### Define Custom CSS Color Variables

Source: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/main/skills/shadcn/customization.md

CSS definitions for custom color variables (`--warning`, `--warning-foreground`) for both light and dark modes in the global CSS file.

```css
/* 1. Define in the global CSS file. */
:root {
  --warning: oklch(0.84 0.16 84);
  --warning-foreground: oklch(0.28 0.07 46);
}
.dark {
  --warning: oklch(0.41 0.11 46);
  --warning-foreground: oklch(0.99 0.02 95);
}
```

--------------------------------

### Theming with CSS variables

Source: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/main/apps/v4/content/docs/changelog/2023-06-new-cli.mdx

Set tailwind.cssVariables to true in components.json to use semantic CSS variables for theming.

```tsx
<div className="bg-background text-foreground" />
```

```json
{
  "tailwind": {
    "config": "tailwind.config.js",
    "css": "app/globals.css",
    "baseColor": "slate",
    "cssVariables": true
  }
}
```

### Theming

Source: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/main/apps/v4/content/docs/(root)/theming.mdx

To use CSS variables for theming, set `tailwind.cssVariables` to `true` in your `components.json` file. This is the default.

